    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39155" root="نبت" body-key="n">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنبتهُ</span></b>  [<i>He endeavoured to make it grow,</i>
or <i>vegetate,</i> or <i>germinate</i>]. (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بلس</span>.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنبتهُ بالبَذْرِ</span> [<i>He grew it,</i> or <i>raised it, by means
of seed</i>], and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالنَّوَى</span> [<i>by means of date-stones</i>],
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالغَرْسِ</span> [<i>by means of planting</i>]. (Mgh, art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حرث</span>.)

